/// M03 CORE-004 "bundled bytes: roundtrip roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/bytes_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledBytes.
/// Related fixtures: compiler/testdata/current/bytes/roundtrip.can
/// (ground for every root pin below: roundtrip 2, integers 3,
/// base64_of_text 2, text_of_base64 2, hex_of_text 2, text_of_hex 2,
/// empty_size 1, captured 1, callable_roundtrip 1, main 1 = 17 roots).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with passed report and exactly
/// 17 roots grounded per function in roundtrip.can.
/// Byte-data preservation facets and offline behavior live in
/// core-004-byte-preservation.can; the run output/status shape and silent
/// production entry live in core-004-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: roundtrip.can fixture.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23).
/// Case bundled/bytes-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, roundtrip-roots, integers-roots,
/// base64enc-roots, base64dec-roots, hexenc-roots, hexdec-roots,
/// empty-roots, captured-roots, callable-roots, main-roots.
/// Facet map (bytes_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L68-71: exit 0, empty stderr); report-passed/root-count pin the report
/// leg (L72-75: passed true, 17 assertions); fixture-name grounds the 17
/// roots in roundtrip.can; roundtrip-roots pins roundtrip (roundtrip.can
/// L9-10: multibyte "héllo 😀" => ok same, empty "" => ok ""); 
/// integers-roots pins integers (L21-23: edges [0,255,128] => ok same,
/// [-1]/[256] => codec::invalid_data byte_range); base64enc-roots pins
/// base64_of_text (L34-35: sample => ok "aMOpbGxvIPCfmIA=", empty => ok
/// ""); base64dec-roots pins text_of_base64 (L46-47: sample => ok "héllo
/// 😀", "QQ" => codec::invalid_data base64); hexenc-roots pins hex_of_text
/// (L58-59: sample => ok "68c3a96c6c6f20f09f9880", empty => ok "");
/// hexdec-roots pins text_of_hex (L70-71: uppercase sample => ok "héllo
/// 😀", "0g" => codec::invalid_data hex); empty-roots pins empty_size
/// (L80: => ok 0); captured-roots pins captured (L88: empty => ok "");
/// callable-roots pins callable_roundtrip (L95: sample => ok sample);
/// main-roots pins main (L106: [] => ok).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
